OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for raping sleeping
OL,4,Awoman after night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped a woman while she was
OL,7,Fasleep on a couch has been jailed for
OL,8,Fseven-and-a-half years.
OL,10,FGraeme Gate had gone on a night out
OL,11,Fwith the woman and her friend before he
OL,12,Fsexually assaulted her at a house in
OL,13,FInverness on 23 August 2025.
OL,15,FShe had never met Gate before that
OL,16,Fnight.
OL,18,FGate, 35, pleaded guilty to the rape
OL,19,Fcharge last month.
